      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]Like a mighty [A7/E]army moves the [D/F#]church [A/E]of [D]God;",
        "[D/F#]brothers, we are [Em]treading where the saints have [A]trod.",
        "[A]We are not divided, [D]all one body we,",
        "[G]one [D]in [G/B]hope [D]and [G]doctrine, [D]one [G]in charity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]Crowns and thrones [A7/E]my [Em]perish, [A7/G]kingdoms [D/F#]rise [A/E]and [D]wane,",
        "[D/F#]but the church of [Em]Jesus constant will remain.",
        "[A]Gates of hell [D]can never 'gainst that church prevail;",
        "[G]we [D]have [G/B]Christ's [D]own [G]promise, [D]and [G]that cannot fail."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[D]Onward then, ye [A7/E]people, join our happy [A/E]throng,",
        "[D/F#]blend with ours your [Em]voices in the triumph song.",
        "[A]Glory, laud, and [D]honor unto Christ the King,",
        "[G]this [D]through [G/B]countless ages [D]men [G]and angels sing."
      ]
    }
